{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b7ff245b9d358ac8a8d94482046969da9522e55c9cddd637b0aa22c005b1fa48","ja":"あっ！　お母さん、ありがとう！\nそこに置いてもらって大丈夫だよ！","zh":"啊！妈妈，谢谢你！\n放在那里就可以了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1d39e1e5d7fe693be16b41ceb514a3aa0c87b0c214c49bc9a557055a4fbc96bd","ja":"ありがとうございます。それでは、いただきます。\nとっても美味しそうだぞ……じゅるり。","zh":"谢谢。那么我就开动了。\n看起来特别好吃……咕噜。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a9771c6ff7e45594bbdf616e7aee560b139b55662381d41296d6703822d5e1eb","ja":"あ、あの、私の小籠包……、\nよ、よかったら……みんなも食べてください……♪","zh":"啊、那个，我的小笼包……要、要是不嫌弃的话……大家也请尝尝……♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4eb88d0d6e0e23eb1d89ffff658b212d9f48c8ed85a0b91c291eb0786542b7a5","ja":"ワタシのラーメンもシェアしようヨ！\n麺がもっちもちで、最高だヨ～！","zh":"也来分享我的拉面吧！\n面条QQ弹弹的，太棒啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"371ff71e38fd43411e115cd5d1bd350e50ea7ed7a72b964e731e44b4c347ad19","ja":"できたて炒飯も、本当に美味しい！\nふふっ……。","zh":"刚做好的炒饭，也真的很好吃！\n呵呵……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"34209793f319411e2aa542da38120110d1a593f8df4324458d5448b11e5282e1","ja":"……うん、やっぱりお料理はこうでなくっちゃ！\n私……今回のオファー、断っちゃうねっ！","zh":"……嗯，做料理就该是这样才对！\n我……这次的邀约，还是拒绝掉吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"b22183f9ad52ab6a4ec6fa7daaaa7d7098ba0485d77a80deb327f7f9c54cd2f3","ja":"数日後。可憐と瑞希とエレナが\n美奈子に呼ばれて劇場に行くと……","zh":"几天后，可怜、瑞希和艾莲娜被美奈子叫到剧场后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"71c3f75d3e3997aa429207f8f1285b18712a48cc987ec0ba84f107d10a283fd7","ja":"いい香り……わあっ……！？\nこれ……もしかして。","zh":"好香……哇……！？\n这个……难道是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"9e065f26a618f88fe7caf260103dbd267ed7cf5e637337e17e77dafce1d4fa9e","ja":"特盛の麻婆豆腐に春巻き、餃子やエビチリも……。\n……満漢全席みたいだぞ。","zh":"超大份麻婆豆腐、春卷，还有饺子和干烧虾仁……。\n……简直像满汉全席一样。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"d39de5b0b573234a7da7f7fe376c59e1a72d8d10906780e8c93c9de3d1f79a5e","ja":"みんな、この間は本当にありがとう！\nお礼に作ったんだ。いっぱい食べていってね♪","zh":"大家，之前真的谢谢你们！\n这是我为答谢大家做的。请尽情享用吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"26421662cb9264c31c2ad368057de9c78492df3142d2d20f6f7427920cd69c43","ja":"デザートも用意してるからね。\n杏仁豆腐に、ごま団子♪","zh":"甜点也准备好了哦。\n有杏仁豆腐和芝麻团子♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"8ca4ac40bbc01b9d7adb89982beb2410a154f03a982b0bed9677f8e5fccbae14","ja":"ワーイ♪\nミナコが元気になって、本当によかったヨ～！","zh":"耶～♪\n美奈子恢复精神了，真是太好了哟～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[53].text","source_sha256":"53e048527e9fbf15a6c51bd292c2fced560f33277909131e62687699db1d8322","ja":"は、はい。本当に。でも……\nこ、この量は……私たちだけだと……その……。","zh":"是、是的。真的。不过……\n这、这么多……只靠我们的话……那个……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1809.unity3d","item_key":"commands[54].text","source_sha256":"5ee403ea7f9d23cfe02e23697ec7e4a79d071ecf3645253eb23d27ae281d8786","ja":"他のみんなにも連絡してみましょう。\n……美味しいご飯、みんなで食べれば、ぺろりだぞ。","zh":"也联系一下其他人吧。\n……美味的饭菜，大家一起吃的话，一下子就能吃光啦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
